# UNERA V2 Color System — Complete Reference

**Canonical implementations**

| Reference | Use for |
|-----|---|
| `NewUnera/dashboard-enhanced.html` | App shell, cards, stats, nav, broad surface system |
| `NewUnera/get-unera-cad.html` / `NewUnera/redeem-unera-cad.html` | Transactional flows: steppers, selection hierarchy, soft banners, quote/processing UI |
| `NewUnera/brand-style-guide.html` | Raw brand values and tokens |

When building **new flow pages** under `NewUnera/`, reuse the **flow surface tokens** and **semantic splits** below so selection, warnings, and destinations stay consistent with Get/Redeem CAD.

---

## 1. V1 → V2 Color Conversion Map

Every V1 color had a direct V2 replacement. Semantic token names were **preserved** so existing references keep working without search-and-replace.

| Token | V1 value | V2 value | Rationale |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--primary-green` | `#10B981` (emerald) | `#173d47` (deep blue) | Brand repositioning — institutional teal-navy conveys trust over fintech green |
| `--primary-blue` | `#0EA5E9` (sky blue) | `#90c2b8` (light blue) | Softened; now used for secondary/info surfaces, not primary actions |
| `--accent-pink` | `#EC4899` (pink) | `#ffffab` (yellow) | Yellow is warmer, higher legibility on dark surfaces; replaces pink as the pop accent |
| `--gradient-primary` | `green→sky blue` | **`var(--brand-deep-blue)`** on product HTML | Dark brand chrome: headings emphasis, stepper, badges (solid — no gradient) |
| `--gradient-sky` | `sky→blue` | **`color-mix(cloud-blue 50%, white)`** | Light cool tint token (solid mix) |
| `--gradient-warm` | `amber→pink` | **`color-mix(yellow 30%, white)`** | Warm accent tint token (solid mix) |
| `--success` | `#059669` | `var(--fin-up)` = **`#1a7a5e`** | P&L positive / success — **not** `--brand-light-blue` (that’s for soft surfaces only) |
| `--error` | `#EF4444` | `var(--brand-red)` = `#ab5770` | Same mauve as `--fin-down` (see §3); disambiguate by context, not hue |
| `--warning` | `#F59E0B` | `#b8a030` | Darker amber for AA compliance on white cards |
| `--neutral-900` | `#1F2937` | `#173d47` | Neutrals re-anchored to deep-blue tonal family |
| `--text-primary` | `#0F172A` | `#173d47` | Consistent with deep-blue anchor |
| `--text-secondary` | `#475569` | `#3d6b78` | Mid-teal, softer contrast ratio while still AA |
| `--border-subtle` | `#E2E8F0` | `rgba(23,61,71,0.13)` | Tinted border — reads as part of the brand canvas, not generic grey |

New V2-only tokens (no V1 equivalent):

```css
--brand-deep-blue:  #173d47   /* primary brand anchor */
--brand-yellow:     #ffffab   /* accent / active / CTA on dark */
--brand-cloud-blue: #ebfcf5   /* page/surface wash */
--brand-earth:      #cec4b8   /* warm secondary surface */
--brand-light-blue: #90c2b8   /* soft tints, clouds; NOT P&L amount ink (--fin-up is #1a7a5e) */
--brand-red:        #ab5770   /* UI errors / P&L down — also --error / --fin-down */
--brand-purple:     #6a5770   /* secondary accent */
--gradient-ink:     var(--brand-deep-blue)   /* nav, primary CTA card — solid on product HTML */
--gradient-deep:    var(--brand-deep-blue)   /* primary CTA / heroes — solid */
--gradient-dusk:    var(--brand-deep-blue)   /* legacy; solid on product HTML */
```

