## 3. Financial Semantic Tokens (P&L) — Aligned to Brand Swatches

**`--fin-up` is the positive-figure / success green `#1a7a5e`** (not `--brand-light-blue`). **`--fin-down`** is **`var(--brand-red)`**. Full rules: [`newunera-financial-direction-colors.mdc`](newunera-financial-direction-colors.mdc).

```css
/* P&L direction — gains, inflows, positive deltas, “you receive” highlights */
--fin-up:    #1a7a5e;   /* rgb(26, 122, 94) — stronger on white than #90c2b8 */
--fin-up-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fin-up) 12%, var(--brand-white));

/* P&L direction — losses, outflows, negative deltas (same hue as form errors) */
--fin-down:    var(--brand-red);   /* #ab5770 */
--fin-down-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-red) 12%, var(--brand-white));

--fin-neutral:     #6b9090;   /* flat/unchanged — distinct from #1a7a5e fin-up */
--fin-neutral-bg:  rgba(107, 144, 144, 0.10);

/* UI validation / alerts — same mauve as --fin-down; separate by placement + copy + patterns */
--error:    var(--brand-red);
--error-bg: rgba(171, 87, 112, 0.10);
```

**Cognitive model:** loss figures and form errors share the **brand mauve** — users disambiguate via **context** (ledger row vs inline field), **wording**, and **icons** — not a second “loss-only” red.

Usage:
- `.amount--positive` → `color: var(--fin-up)`
- `.amount--negative` → `color: var(--fin-down)`
- `.impact-trend` pill → `background: var(--fin-up-bg); color: var(--fin-up)`
- `.impact-trend--down` pill → `background: var(--fin-down-bg); color: var(--fin-down)`
- Form error states → `--error` / `--error-bg` (same hue as fin-down; different components)

