## 6. Per-Card Icon Background Differentiation

Each icon container uses a unique **solid** `color-mix` tint so cards are instantly scannable without text:

```css
.impact-icon--portfolio { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-purple) 16%, var(--brand-white)); }
.impact-icon--yield     { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-cloud-blue) 45%, var(--brand-white)); }
.impact-icon--donations { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-yellow) 28%, var(--brand-white)); }
.impact-icon--lives     { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-light-blue) 22%, var(--brand-white)); }
```

**Rule**: Differentiate icon wells with `color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-*), var(--brand-white))` — no CSS gradients on product HTML.

**See also**: `newunera-icons.mdc` §Sizing table — the inner `<svg>` width/height should match the well size (e.g. 56 well → 28 svg, 48 well → 24 svg). Icons use `fill="currentColor"` only, never `stroke`.

