## 8. Card Hover & Focus States

```css
/* All cards */
.card:hover, .impact-card:hover, .action-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-deep-blue);          /* NOT primary-green */
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(23, 61, 71, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-4px);                    /* standard lift */
}
/* Focus ring — light backgrounds */
.card:focus, .impact-card:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--brand-deep-blue);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* Top-accent bar on hover */
.impact-card::before {
    background: var(--brand-deep-blue);
    transform: scaleX(0);                  /* animate in on hover */
}
.impact-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
```

