## 9. Skip Link & Accessibility Color

```css
.skip-link        { background: var(--brand-deep-blue); color: white; }
.skip-link:focus  { outline: 3px solid var(--brand-yellow); }
```

Yellow focus ring on the skip link (dark background context) is correct — do not change to deep-blue here.

