## 10. What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never use `#10B981`, `#0EA5E9`, `#EC4899` — those are V1 colors
- ❌ Never use `--fin-up` for losses or `--fin-down` for gains (wrong P&L semantic)
- ❌ For **form validation and system alerts**, use `--error` / `--error-bg` and established field patterns; for **transaction rows and amount deltas**, use `--fin-down` / `--fin-down-bg` — **same brand mauve** as `--error`, different context (see [`newunera-financial-direction-colors.mdc`](newunera-financial-direction-colors.mdc))
- ❌ Never use flat grey hex for card backgrounds — use a `--surface-*` token (plus §7.1 flow tokens on transactional pages)
- ❌ On flow pages, do **not** fill large selection panels with solid deep-blue — reserve **deep blue** for **titles, stepper active state, and in-progress processing**; use `--surface-action-green` / `--surface-action-green-strong` with `--fin-up` borders for selected rows/cards
- ❌ Never use `linear-gradient` / `radial-gradient` / `repeating-linear-gradient` on product HTML (`NewUnera/*.html` except `brand-style-guide.html`) — see `.cursor/rules/new-brand-output.mdc` **No CSS gradients on product HTML**
- ❌ Never use `--primary-green` / `--accent-pink` for hover states on the dark nav — yellow only
- ❌ Never import Space Grotesk — TestFoundersGrotesk only
- ❌ Never save new-brand files outside `NewUnera/`
